    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "2691b0b9-bed7-406d-9b1b-c828beca4d94",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Deadly Rivals 26: Mumbai Movie Madness",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MUMBAI",
        "PublicId": "113188955603",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Mumbai/scene_mongoose.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 22cdb031-155a-441f-a882-336dfc7b04e1).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rWe find ourselves in the middle of a war for creative control. Gregory Arthur (real name Gilfor Bootyswang) and Dawood Rangan each seek control of their film. Mr. Arthur has contracted The Kashmirian to eliminate Mr. Rangan, but was discovered by Mr. Raav, so he needs him out of the way. Mr. Raav has contracted us to eliminate the other hitman directly.\r\rMeanwhile, Mr. Rangan has hired the local holy man to kill Mr. Arthur, and the Kashmirian seeks to protect him.\r\rGood luck.",
